Automated CI/CD Pipelines & Splunk Data Stream Integrations
Integrated GitHub Actions automated testing suites to validate code quality across pull requests. Configured HTTP Event Collector (HEC) endpoints to push structured metrics into Splunk dashboards.

Architecture Overview
[ Git Push / PR ] ──> [ GitHub Actions Pipeline ]
                             │
                             ├── 1. Code Linting & Unit Tests (Pytest)
                             ├── 2. Build & Test Docker Container
                             └── 3. Deploy App / Run Telemetry Service
                                         │
                                         ▼
                             [ Python Async Application ]
                                         │  (JSON via HTTP POST)
                                         ▼
                            [ Splunk HEC Token Endpoint ]
                                         │
                                         ▼
